#HELPS
1 GRO BAGRAT PLANTATION~
Gro-Bagrat Plantation is a guarded rural estate set north of the city of Vivec
where fields of willow anther surround a manor watched by many armed sentries.
No farmers work the fertile fields despite the rows of carefully tended shrubs
for a hidden basement serves as an illegal skooma workshop.~
